# Config sync

When adding or renaming a TOML key:

1. Update the struct + `Default` in `crates/skyline-core/src/config.rs`
2. Update `examples/config.toml` (embedded in the binary)
3. Document in `README.md` and `docs/skyline.1` if user-visible
4. If services must see it without restart, add a knob in `live.rs` and apply it in `reload_from_config`

Hot-reload covers theme, modules, bar geometry, clock format, sys refresh, custom modules, and clicks. Compositor `backend` still requires a process restart.
